# Copy to `.env` (git-ignored) in the repo root. The backend reads it at startup; restart `make dev` after editing.
# AI layer (Google Gemini only): always on when a key is set. Leave the key empty to run fully rule-based.
# Google AI Studio key (https://aistudio.google.com/apikey):
GEMINI_API_KEY=
# Opt-out even with a key: VAVAGYM_LLM=0
# Optional: VAVAGYM_LLM_MODEL=<one model, disables the fallback chain>
